+**Problem**: Job ID mismatch between UI and backend
+
+1. **UI creates UUID**: `63e12984-d69e-407a-bf6d-f562847c3de0`
+2. **UI tries to pass it** to `SH.start_background_job(job_id=new_job_id)`
