+try:
+    # ... JIT resolution code ...
+except Exception:
+    logger.exception('Unexpected error during JIT resolution')
+
+# NOW OUTSIDE THE EXCEPT BLOCK - runs every time:
+started_job_id = SH.start_background_job(target_fn, args=(), kwargs=job_params, job_name='trends_analysis')
+```
